<title>UK: Gilt futures set fresh contract high of 107-22.</title>
<headline>Gilt futures set fresh contract high of 107-22.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>December gilt futures set a new contract high of 107-22 on Friday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The previous high was 107-19, set on August 16.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
